  "validationCorrections": [
    "Initial focused193pass/9fail: service codec/scope assertions now check public code fields rather than internal code strings as human messages. The task-group fixture now retains the current member repository set required by the existing real database policy. The facade test checks the existing UNKNOWN_OPERATION exception plus the useful unavailable capability state.",
    "Five compiler errors were control-flow narrowing and definite-assignment errors at a const arrow never-returning helper. An explicitly declared never-returning function preserves runtime refusal semantics and lets the compiler verify root, target, result and callback narrowing.",
    "Initial full application and standalone suites passed before lint required simplifying one single-assignment cleanup callback declaration. A direct deferred closure over the actual initialized workspace owner removes the alias. Affected focused checks, forced compiler/lint, shipping build and fresh packaged-stage/private proof are rerun; initial passing full suites are retained and final integrated suites cover the delivered source."
  ],
